    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d587-a1">

                <pb facs="0639" n="589" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg589"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 245.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-12-20"><hi rendition="#italic">December 20,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have induced minister for the colonies to order by telegraph transfer for
                    review of seven hard cases selected by me, including Máicas and Hidalgo. He
                    promises immediate and equitable action as to all unjust fines.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Taylor.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
